menu "ECU sensor harness"

    choice SENSOR_HARNESS_MODE
        prompt "Sensor harness mode"
        default SENSOR_HARNESS_MODE_FAKE
        help
            Select where the ESP32-S3 sensor harness reads its input data.
            Fake mode injects deterministic samples. Real mode enables only
            the currently confirmed GPIO/ADC inputs.

        config SENSOR_HARNESS_MODE_FAKE
            bool "Fake injected samples"
            help
                Run the real sensor services against deterministic fake
                samples for repeatable bring-up and plotting.

        config SENSOR_HARNESS_MODE_REAL
            bool "Real confirmed GPIO/ADC inputs"
            help
                Read TPS from ADC1_CH6/GPIO7 and poll GPIO9/GPIO14 for
                quick-shifter and map-switch testing. Pickup, EGT, water NTC
                and knock hardware remain disabled until their board wiring is
                confirmed.

    endchoice

endmenu
